  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of audit of Tralac</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upphandling av revision av Tralac</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida entered into a new agreement with Tralac in 2015, whereby it is agreed that 32 MSEK will be disbursed to Tralac from 2015 to 2019. The funds are provided as core support, i.e. un-earmarked funds in support of Tralac&#x2019;s Strategic Framework 2015-2019. The review is carried out in accordance with agreement between Sida and Tralac. Tralac&#x2019;s management response to - and implementation plan for possible recommendations from - this review is a precondition for the planned March 2016 disbursement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ingick 2015 ett nytt avtal med Tralac, vari det ingick att Sida ska betala ut 32 MSEK till Tralac mellan 2015 och 2019. Medlen ges som basbudgetst&#xf6;d, allts&#xe5; icke-&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt st&#xf6;d till Tralacs strategiska plan 2015-2019. Denna &#xf6;versyn genomf&#xf6;rs i enlighet med avtal mellan Sida och Tralac. Tralacs ledningssvar (management response) till - och genomf&#xf6;randeplan f&#xf6;r m&#xf6;jliga rekommendationer fr&#xe5;n - genomg&#xe5;ngen &#xe4;r ett f&#xf6;rhandsvillkor f&#xf6;r planerad utbetalning mars 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
